1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

2
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">hikarabita kotoba wo tsunai de</font></font></b></font></font>

4
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">connecting old words that have<font color="#ffffff"> been used up</font></font></font></b></font></font>

5
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo bokura shinpuru na omoi wo tsutaetai dake na no</font></font></b></font></font>

6
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I just want to convey my simple thoughts</font></font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">fukinukeru kusunda ano hi no kaze wa</font></font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:41,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Drink! Sing!</font>

26
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's have fun!</font>

27
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:46,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good grief... This is too much for...
a pre-celebration.</font>

28
00:01:48,750 --> 00:01:49,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you take care of the business?</font>

29
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:52,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

30
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:56,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly
the rain's starting to let up.</font>

31
00:01:57,050 --> 00:02:00,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shouldn't you quickly put an end
to this farce of a race?</font>

32
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:02,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine.</font>

33
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guess I'll go for a run!</font>

34
00:02:28,830 --> 00:02:30,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Above here huh?</font>

35
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:31,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

36
00:02:32,090 --> 00:02:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a quite a long staircase.</font>

37
00:02:36,050 --> 00:02:39,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're also called
the Stone Steps that Tear Hearts Apart.</font>

38
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh, cool!</font>

39
00:02:42,010 --> 00:02:43,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go at a sprint!</font>

40
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, he's kidding right?</font>

41
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:57,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of stamina does he have?</font>

42
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:06,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss.</font>

43
00:03:08,290 --> 00:03:10,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems Idate is heading this way!</font>

44
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:14,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He hasn't run away
just like you said Boss.</font>

45
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course...</font>

46
00:03:19,590 --> 00:03:21,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I saw potential in him.</font>

47
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now it's just a little more!
Run Idate!</font>

48
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:34,560
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Just Before</font>

49
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:34,560
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the Goal!</font>

50
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:34,560
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Fierce Battle</font>

51
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:34,560
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">of Roaring Thunder</font>

52
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:42,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... you...!</font>

53
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

54
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:45,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me tell you...</font>

55
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:48,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like I trust you
or anything yet okay?</font>

56
00:03:48,370 --> 00:03:49,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah yeah whatever.</font>

57
00:03:49,620 --> 00:03:51,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't really matter to me.</font>

58
00:03:53,420 --> 00:03:57,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a person
who still trusts you right?!</font>

59
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:05,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">During the Chunin Exam...</font>

60
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:07,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

61
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:11,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said that a tenth problem
appeared, right?</font>

62
00:04:11,730 --> 00:04:17,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. It was a weird problem to determine
whether you'd take the problem or not.</font>

63
00:04:18,940 --> 00:04:19,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three years ago...</font>

64
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:24,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got a similar problem...</font>

65
00:04:25,910 --> 00:04:29,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, now I'm going to
give the tenth problem.</font>

66
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The tenth problem...</font>

67
00:04:33,290 --> 00:04:36,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of problem is
Big Brother going to give?!</font>

68
00:04:37,460 --> 00:04:38,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The tenth problem is a battle</font>

69
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:42,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the Three-Man Squad
you were teamed up with.</font>

70
00:04:45,010 --> 00:04:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The three of you will compete against
each other this exercise.</font>

71
00:04:48,470 --> 00:04:52,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And among you...
one of you will be failed!</font>

72
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:57,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the one who is failed
will remain a Genin for life</font>

73
00:04:57,770 --> 00:05:01,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and we will never again
let them take the Chunin Exam!</font>

74
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way...</font>

75
00:05:02,690 --> 00:05:05,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then for what purpose
were we together until now?</font>

76
00:05:05,660 --> 00:05:07,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I make the rules here.</font>

77
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:10,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Back-talk is not allowed at all!</font>

78
00:05:12,370 --> 00:05:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want to withdraw
you should do so.</font>

79
00:05:16,420 --> 00:05:20,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Withdrawing here and
waiting half a year is also a way.</font>

80
00:05:22,590 --> 00:05:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If one person among
the three withdraws</font>

81
00:05:26,050 --> 00:05:28,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of course all three members
will be disqualified.</font>

82
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:31,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you will be allowed
to take the Chunin Exam</font>

83
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:33,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one more time in half a year.</font>

84
00:05:35,180 --> 00:05:36,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what will you do?</font>

85
00:05:38,940 --> 00:05:41,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One comrade will be dropped.</font>

86
00:05:42,940 --> 00:05:44,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have the confidence to pass.</font>

87
00:05:47,030 --> 00:05:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But one of them will remain
a Genin for life.</font>

88
00:05:59,130 --> 00:06:01,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a choice between
comrades and your life.</font>

89
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:04,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're going to quit
now's the time.</font>

90
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:10,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there nobody else
who's going to withdraw?</font>

91
00:06:12,970 --> 00:06:13,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're good then.</font>

92
00:06:17,770 --> 00:06:21,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay to everyone who
has remained here...</font>

93
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I render you disqualified!</font>

94
00:06:26,030 --> 00:06:27,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-Why...?</font>

95
00:06:28,070 --> 00:06:29,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hold on a minute!</font>

96
00:06:29,910 --> 00:06:32,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I prepared myself and remained here!</font>

97
00:06:32,580 --> 00:06:34,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such preparedness is below contempt!</font>

98
00:06:35,330 --> 00:06:39,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scums like you don't have
the qualifications to become Chunin!</font>

99
00:06:40,630 --> 00:06:41,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's all!</font>

100
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

101
00:06:46,340 --> 00:06:48,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What kind of a test was it
for you guys?</font>

102
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:53,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I forgot...</font>

103
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:58,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean it was explained to me
but I didn't really get it.</font>

104
00:06:58,850 --> 00:07:01,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Trusting in my big brother's words
I remained in the classroom.</font>

105
00:07:02,690 --> 00:07:04,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And yet I was failed!</font>

106
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:10,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way could I take that.
I questioned my big brother.</font>

107
00:07:12,030 --> 00:07:13,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big Brother!
What's up with that test?!</font>

108
00:07:14,870 --> 00:07:16,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shinobi reads the double bluff.</font>

109
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:21,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should've understood
that was the test.</font>

110
00:07:21,710 --> 00:07:23,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so I can't accept that!</font>

111
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how dangerous</font>

112
00:07:25,340 --> 00:07:27,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">isn't it necessary to have
the courage to plunge into any mission?!</font>

113
00:07:28,210 --> 00:07:29,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate.</font>

114
00:07:31,430 --> 00:07:33,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you really not accept it?</font>

115
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:36,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course not such a...</font>

116
00:07:37,970 --> 00:07:41,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... quit as a Ninja.</font>

117
00:07:44,310 --> 00:07:46,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're telling me to quit
then I will.</font>

118
00:07:46,770 --> 00:07:49,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But tell me why I'm no good!</font>

119
00:07:50,780 --> 00:07:52,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's something you should
realize yourself</font>

120
00:07:53,030 --> 00:07:55,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with your own power.</font>

121
00:07:58,660 --> 00:08:01,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To this day... I don't understand
the answer to that.</font>

122
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So after that
you were deceived by Aoi, huh?</font>

123
00:08:05,630 --> 00:08:07,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, that's right.</font>

124
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:15,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We made it... to the top!</font>

125
00:08:16,850 --> 00:08:20,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going by myself from here.
You rest!</font>

126
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:23,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! You still saying stuff like that?!</font>

127
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:26,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't be asking you guys
to help any more.</font>

128
00:08:27,020 --> 00:08:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point if I don't win by myself
on my own strength!</font>

129
00:08:31,110 --> 00:08:32,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... hey! Idate!</font>

130
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:36,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can make it! It seems
Sakura's special medicine has worked!</font>

131
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blast!</font>

132
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This doesn't hurt!</font>

133
00:08:45,330 --> 00:08:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm back in the game...
from here!</font>

134
00:09:03,430 --> 00:09:06,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we cross this suspension bridge
it's Ouzu Island, huh?</font>

135
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:08,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should hurry.</font>

136
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:12,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems Idate has made it
to the Modoroki Shrine.</font>

137
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

138
00:09:13,690 --> 00:09:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems we underestimated
the Leaf Genin a bit...</font>

139
00:09:17,070 --> 00:09:20,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk!
You didn't finish them?!</font>

140
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:23,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now's not the time to be talking
about stuff like that.</font>

141
00:09:24,250 --> 00:09:26,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please cross the bridge quickly!</font>

142
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Useless Ninja!</font>

143
00:09:32,090 --> 00:09:35,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! I'm only helping you
because it's the job.</font>

144
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:40,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll waste you if you keep
talking smart to me.</font>

145
00:09:41,180 --> 00:09:42,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm sorry...</font>

146
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:45,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you've understood
then get a move on!</font>

147
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:46,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes!</font>

148
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There he is! That Fukusuke jerk!</font>

149
00:09:59,490 --> 00:10:00,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is quite something.</font>

150
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:04,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never thought
you'd make it this far.</font>

151
00:10:05,660 --> 00:10:08,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the...
Blade of the Thunder God!</font>

152
00:10:19,180 --> 00:10:20,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

153
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:24,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

154
00:10:27,390 --> 00:10:28,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop kicking a dead horse.</font>

155
00:10:29,350 --> 00:10:32,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody is a match for
the legendary Blade of the Thunder God</font>

156
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:36,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">said to have been used
by the Second Hokage.</font>

157
00:10:38,570 --> 00:10:40,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should know this well.</font>

158
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:45,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all you're the man
who stole this for me.</font>

159
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:47,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blast...</font>

160
00:10:53,790 --> 00:10:58,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mud balls, huh?
It's just like a kid's fight.</font>

161
00:10:58,670 --> 00:11:01,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, I didn't have
any Kunai Knives.</font>

162
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

163
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:07,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you won't be able to dodge
the next ball just with that.</font>

164
00:11:08,730 --> 00:11:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

165
00:11:16,110 --> 00:11:18,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's concentrating
the Chakra in his palm.</font>

166
00:11:20,450 --> 00:11:21,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I come!</font>

167
00:11:23,620 --> 00:11:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I come!</font>

168
00:11:29,580 --> 00:11:30,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once more!</font>

169
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:44,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what
you intend to do but...</font>

170
00:11:50,350 --> 00:11:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Senbon Rainstorm!</font>

171
00:11:55,980 --> 00:11:57,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad.</font>

172
00:11:57,520 --> 00:12:00,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Blade of the Thunder God
cuts through anything!</font>

173
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:03,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even Chakra itself is no exception.</font>

174
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

175
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:09,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to make doubly sure</font>

176
00:12:10,290 --> 00:12:12,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so that nothing troublesome
will happen again.</font>

177
00:12:13,290 --> 00:12:16,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm your opponent!
Keep your hands off Idate!</font>

178
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:19,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph, are you still
saying such things?</font>

179
00:12:20,550 --> 00:12:24,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Saving each other protecting each other
trusting each other.</font>

180
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:26,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It ticks me off!</font>

181
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:30,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The weak can't survive
if they don't support each other.</font>

182
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:35,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So they trust people easily
and are betrayed.</font>

183
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:39,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weaklings like you guys
should just run about and away.</font>

184
00:12:40,650 --> 00:12:42,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Idate?</font>

185
00:12:43,780 --> 00:12:46,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was like that also
when you stole</font>

186
00:12:46,620 --> 00:12:48,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this Blade of the Thunder God, right?</font>

187
00:12:55,210 --> 00:12:58,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can see it.
That's the Village Hidden in the Rain.</font>

188
00:13:01,590 --> 00:13:02,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aoi-sensei?!</font>

189
00:13:07,010 --> 00:13:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aoi-sensei!</font>

190
00:13:11,180 --> 00:13:12,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate...</font>

191
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:13,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-Big Brother...</font>

192
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:15,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot!</font>

193
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:18,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go back to the village immediately
and surrender yourself!</font>

194
00:13:20,980 --> 00:13:21,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You?!</font>

195
00:13:22,610 --> 00:13:25,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know what
you have done?</font>

196
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:28,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

197
00:13:31,450 --> 00:13:35,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strict as always, eh?
And he's your cute little brother.</font>

198
00:13:36,170 --> 00:13:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's truly perfect that
you've shown up here.</font>

199
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aoi-sensei...</font>

200
00:13:43,130 --> 00:13:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This forbidden Jutsu scroll
can't be deciphered</font>

201
00:13:45,170 --> 00:13:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">unless you're Jonin class.</font>

202
00:13:48,140 --> 00:13:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have the brothers
betray the Leaf Village together.</font>

203
00:14:07,950 --> 00:14:11,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ibiki, please decipher it already.</font>

204
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I refuse.</font>

205
00:14:13,620 --> 00:14:17,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So are you choosing death
together with Idate?</font>

206
00:14:19,790 --> 00:14:21,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such as he is
he's also a Shinobi.</font>

207
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:24,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not afraid of death.</font>

208
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't seem so.</font>

209
00:14:31,140 --> 00:14:33,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This face is one taut with fear.</font>

210
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:39,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm quitting as a Ninja!
So please don't kill me!</font>

211
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:42,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please decipher it.</font>

212
00:14:42,980 --> 00:14:45,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't want to see
your cute little brother killed</font>

213
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:47,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before your eyes do you?</font>

214
00:14:48,700 --> 00:14:50,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Little brother you say?</font>

215
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:52,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That fool?</font>

216
00:14:53,370 --> 00:14:54,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big Brother...</font>

217
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:58,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such a threat means nothing to me.</font>

218
00:15:01,580 --> 00:15:05,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Ibiki, is the Village Hidden
in the Leaves that important?</font>

219
00:15:07,420 --> 00:15:09,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you protect it at
the risk of your own life</font>

220
00:15:09,630 --> 00:15:11,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're nothing but a pawn!</font>

221
00:15:13,550 --> 00:15:15,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's why
you became a traitor?</font>

222
00:15:17,060 --> 00:15:18,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a pathetic man!</font>

223
00:15:19,350 --> 00:15:20,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You punk!</font>

224
00:15:34,070 --> 00:15:34,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate!</font>

225
00:15:36,030 --> 00:15:37,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You run away!</font>

226
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:39,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about you Big Brother?</font>

227
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:42,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go after I clean up
the mess here!</font>

228
00:15:42,670 --> 00:15:44,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think so!</font>

229
00:15:53,470 --> 00:15:54,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big Brother!</font>

230
00:15:55,180 --> 00:15:56,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go quickly!</font>

231
00:15:56,850 --> 00:15:58,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Big Brother...!</font>

232
00:15:58,350 --> 00:16:01,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go! Having you stay is a burden!</font>

233
00:16:05,110 --> 00:16:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you!</font>

234
00:16:06,940 --> 00:16:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

235
00:16:39,310 --> 00:16:40,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So appalling...</font>

236
00:16:41,230 --> 00:16:44,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that he'd risk
his life for such an idiotic guy.</font>

237
00:16:45,190 --> 00:16:47,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All you could do after that
was run.</font>

238
00:16:48,650 --> 00:16:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You could've returned
to the village and called for help.</font>

239
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you didn't do that.</font>

240
00:16:54,990 --> 00:16:59,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thinking Ibiki was dead
was no excuse!</font>

241
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:02,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fact is he was alive...</font>

242
00:17:03,160 --> 00:17:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that regard,
Ibiki was admirable.</font>

243
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:09,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only did he completely endure
repeated interrogation</font>

244
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:11,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he also retrieved
the Forbidden Jutsu scroll...</font>

245
00:17:12,090 --> 00:17:14,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without having confessed to anything!</font>

246
00:17:19,390 --> 00:17:20,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And to think that he did
all this</font>

247
00:17:21,060 --> 00:17:24,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for his good-for-nothing little brother.</font>

248
00:17:25,770 --> 00:17:28,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You betrayed your village,
abandoned your older brother</font>

249
00:17:29,020 --> 00:17:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and came to think of only yourself.</font>

250
00:17:33,190 --> 00:17:38,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even Ibiki who is blood-related
and risked his life to save you</font>

251
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:40,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you didn't trust him!</font>

252
00:17:41,410 --> 00:17:43,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Afraid of being accused</font>

253
00:17:43,750 --> 00:17:47,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you didn't trust the Village Hidden
in the Leaves your birthplace...</font>

254
00:17:48,540 --> 00:17:49,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You trust nobody.</font>

255
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:53,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not trusted by anyone.</font>

256
00:17:54,130 --> 00:17:57,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For me, there is no pupil
as excellent as you.</font>

257
00:17:58,890 --> 00:18:01,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a reward,
I'll let you die in one instant.</font>

258
00:18:08,270 --> 00:18:09,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate!</font>

259
00:18:09,610 --> 00:18:11,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke... Sakura!</font>

260
00:18:11,900 --> 00:18:13,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rest Naruto!</font>

261
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:16,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll beat this guy!</font>

262
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:20,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be acting cool.</font>

263
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:24,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't beat me no matter
how many people show up.</font>

264
00:18:25,120 --> 00:18:26,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me, Aoi Rokusho</font>

265
00:18:26,830 --> 00:18:30,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Rain Jonin who possesses
the Blade of the Thunder God.</font>

266
00:18:31,630 --> 00:18:32,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that so?</font>

267
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:36,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Interesting.</font>

268
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:39,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Blade of the Thunder God
and my Chidori!</font>

269
00:18:40,590 --> 00:18:43,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's test which is better!</font>

270
00:18:57,570 --> 00:18:59,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rumors were true.</font>

271
00:18:59,990 --> 00:19:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The survivor of the village's honourable
Uchiha Clan...</font>

272
00:19:03,370 --> 00:19:05,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is just a good-for-nothing kid...</font>

273
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:12,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

274
00:19:13,130 --> 00:19:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run, Sakura!</font>

275
00:19:14,500 --> 00:19:16,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll show no mercy
no matter who the person is.</font>

276
00:19:16,510 --> 00:19:18,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone will be killed!</font>

277
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

278
00:19:20,180 --> 00:19:21,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

279
00:19:21,130 --> 00:19:22,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll protect you
no matter what.</font>

280
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:24,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We promised that didn't we?!</font>

281
00:19:25,390 --> 00:19:26,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Trust us!</font>

282
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:29,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now all that's left is
the wounded rabbit</font>

283
00:19:29,890 --> 00:19:32,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the excellent pupil huh?</font>

284
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:36,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You two together
go to the next world.</font>

285
00:19:38,570 --> 00:19:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take it back!</font>

286
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:43,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take it back!</font>

287
00:19:44,700 --> 00:19:45,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you talking about?</font>

288
00:19:46,620 --> 00:19:47,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What you said...</font>

289
00:19:48,750 --> 00:19:50,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">earlier!</font>

290
00:19:52,040 --> 00:19:53,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess...</font>

291
00:19:54,790 --> 00:19:56,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the Uchiha...</font>

292
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with me!</font>

293
00:20:05,680 --> 00:20:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why you...!</font>

294
00:20:33,370 --> 00:20:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

295
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:39,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke! Get up!</font>

296
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:44,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How very cold the bottom
of the ocean must be.</font>

297
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:45,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

298
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:48,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate!</font>

299
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:55,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

300
00:21:01,990 --> 00:21:03,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

301
00:21:07,290 --> 00:21:09,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#ffffff"><b>GET UP aa sumimasen</b></font></font></font>

302
00:21:07,290 --> 00:21:09,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#ffffff"><b>get up! oh, I'm sorry</b></font></font></font>

303
00:21:12,260 --> 00:21:19,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#dc959b"><b>goku tama ni boku tama ni</b></font></font></font>

304
00:21:12,260 --> 00:21:19,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#77dc93"><b>once in a long while, once in a while</b></font></font></font>

305
00:21:19,610 --> 00:21:25,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#dc959b"><b>yume ni yabureru hito no kakera ga</b></font></font></font>

